E","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4893733195/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4893770168","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121004#issuecomment-4893770168","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121004","id":4893770168,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI7EBuA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T14:10:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T14:10:24Z","body":"That's not a bug, the file is converted, please see the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/assets_pipeline/import_process.html#doc-import-process)\n\nIf you have any more questions about this please ask in the [other community channels](https://godotengine.org/community/) (if you run into any other issues, make sure to 